  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">현장체험학습(3학년이지만&nbsp;수학여행)&nbsp;중&nbsp;에버랜드&nbsp;갔다온&nbsp;다음&nbsp;날&nbsp;아이들에게&nbsp;던진&nbsp;질문입니다.&nbsp;<br>에버랜드을&nbsp;다녀오면&nbsp;T익스프레스가&nbsp;뭔지는&nbsp;알게&nbsp;되니&nbsp;문제가&nbsp;뭔&nbsp;말인지는&nbsp;알아본&nbsp;것&nbsp;같구요.&nbsp;제가&nbsp;저걸&nbsp;탈&nbsp;때&nbsp;같이&nbsp;탔던&nbsp;애들이&nbsp;선생님&nbsp;탔다고&nbsp;인증해주니&nbsp;못&nbsp;타는&nbsp;애들의&nbsp;관심을&nbsp;조금&nbsp;더&nbsp;끌&nbsp;수는&nbsp;있더군요&nbsp;ㅋ<br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">애들이&nbsp;2학년&nbsp;때&nbsp;역학적에너지를&nbsp;안&nbsp;배운&nbsp;것처럼&nbsp;연기(?)하더라는..&nbsp;ㅡㅡ;;<br>ㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡ<br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">티익스프레스&nbsp;최고속도&nbsp;104km/h<br>이&nbsp;속도로&nbsp;움직이며&nbsp;바람을&nbsp;맞고&nbsp;낙하와&nbsp;과도한&nbsp;기울어짐을&nbsp;만끽,&nbsp;뚜껑없는&nbsp;의자에서&nbsp;느끼는&nbsp;스릴..&nbsp;<br><br>티익스프레스의&nbsp;낙하높이는?<br><br>낙하높이&nbsp;답이&nbsp;나오면...<br>실제&nbsp;낙하높이랑&nbsp;차이나는&nbsp;이유는?</span><br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2149D64B561FE84A04\" class=\"txc-image\"  id=\"A_2149D64B561FE84A047064\"/></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
